  "reflectionText": "Esther put on her royal robe and stood in the inner court. The king looked up and held out the golden sceptre. She had come to ask for the lives of her people. What is it to walk into a room where the law against you is the king's own law, with no one but yourself to speak on behalf of the people you cannot lose?",
